{"id":23026,"name":"夜色流光溢彩","rarity":5,"path":"Shaman","desc":"同谐命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"岁月从镜中流过，青涩的少女已蜕变为游刃有余的歌者。\\n她打量着镜中的自己，时间改变了一切，唯有那绿色的眼睛依然如同湖泊般宁静，仿佛在诉说着不渝的信念。\\n\\n<i> 「今天看起来兴致很高呢。」</i>\\n<i>「是啊…毕竟有很重要的『演出』。」</i>\\n<i>「嗯，谐乐大典的彩排就要开始了，请您移步准备室。」</i>\\n……\\n\\n她走出化妆室，和身后灯火辉煌的剧院渐行渐远。\\n<i>「我的舞台不在此处。」</i>\\n她闭上双眼，任凭夜色吞没她的影子。\\n<i>「从过去，到现在，我的歌声都只是为了……」</i>\\n<i>「为了那些失去希望的人们。」</i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23026,"name":"抚慰","desc":"我方角色每次攻击时，使装备者获得1层【歌咏】，每层【歌咏】使装备者的能量恢复效率提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[f1]%</unbreak></color>，最多叠加<unbreak>#2[i]</unbreak>层。装备者施放终结技时，移除【歌咏】并获得【华彩】，【华彩】使装备者的攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[i]%</unbreak></color>，使我方全体造成的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[i]%</unbreak></color>，持续<unbreak>#5[i]</unbreak>回合。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.03,5,0.24,0.48,1]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.035,5,0.28,0.6,1]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.04,5,0.32,0.72,1]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.044999998,5,0.36,0.84,1]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.05,5,0.4,0.96,1]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":28.8,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":114001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":63.36,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110231,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":109.44,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":155.52,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":114002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":201.6,"attack_add":4.32,"defe